Unit tests for tuxcards-qt6.

Build and run:

   cmake -S . -B build -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release
   cmake --build build --parallel
   ctest --test-dir build --output-on-failure

The legacy standalone tests.exe driver (TuxCards 2010.06.1) has been
replaced by QTest-based unit suites:

   tst_stringcrypter   round-trip and tampering tests for the
                       AES-256-GCM file format, plus auto-detection of
                       the legacy Blowfish header.
   tst_configparser    set / get / save / load cycle over a temp INI file.
   tst_path            Path round-trip + edge cases.
